# Shape tools (redrawn per move) and gradients on 12 MP.
doc 4000 3000
noise 7 opaque
tool Ellipse
set shape FillOutline
set brush 9
drag L 100 100 3000 2500 60
tool Line
drag L 10 10 3990 2990 60
tool Gradient
set gradient Radial
drag L 2000 1500 3500 2500 20
set gradient Conical
drag L 2000 1500 2500 300 20
